<title>UK: UK manufacturing expanding - Treasury.</title>
<headline>UK manufacturing expanding - Treasury.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK Treasury said in a statement after January industrial and manufacturing data that manufacturing industry continues to enjoy expansion.  </p>
<p>DATA SHOWED</p>
<p>-----------</p>
<p>UK JAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT UNCH MM +2.4% YY, MANUFACTURING</p>
<p>+0.3% MM, +1.6% YY</p>
<p>UK MANUFACTURING OUTPUT +0.3% IN 3MTHS TO JAN VS PVS 3MTHS,</p>
<p>+1.1% VS YR AGO</p>
<p>ONS SAYS UK MANUFACTURING OUTPUT ROSE REVISED 0.4% IN 1996</p>
<p>ON 95 (PVS 0.5%)</p>
<p>- John Speck, London Newsroom +44 171 542-8663</p>
